        "Content": "<ul><li> Converted & Thoughtfully Modernised Three Bedroom Former Schoolhouse</li><li> Beautiful Blend Of Old World Character & Contemporary Finishes</li><li> Mature Site Extending To Approximately 0.5 Acres</li><li> Elevated Village Centre Setting</li><li> Overlooking Kilclonfert GAA Grounds & Community Centre</li><li> Large Front Garden With Mature Trees & Specimen Planting</li><li> Gated Gravel Driveway With Feature Carp Pond</li><li> Belgian Block Patio Area</li><li> Spacious Dual Aspect Kitchen / Dining Room</li><li> Solid Pine Fitted Kitchen With Tiled Floor & Feature Brickwork</li><li> Two Reception Rooms With Character Features</li><li> Ground Floor Bedroom & Family Bathroom</li><li> Reclaimed Pitch Pine Flooring</li><li> Vaulted Tongue-And-Groove Ceilings</li><li> Triple Aspect Entrance Porch</li><li> uPVC Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Dual Fuel Central Heating (Oil-Fired Heating & Pellet Stove With Back Boiler)</ul>"
